stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> IDLE: setup
  IDLE --> ACCEPTING: START while idle
  ACCEPTING --> DETECTING: distance < 25 cm
  DETECTING --> SORTING: three predictions collected
  SORTING --> WAITING_FOR_CLEAR: inline classification/sorting completes
  WAITING_FOR_CLEAR --> ACCEPTING: distance >= 25 cm
  ACCEPTING --> WITHDRAW: withdraw button
  ACCEPTING --> DONATING: donate button
  WITHDRAW --> IDLE: cancel or thank-you completion
  DONATING --> IDLE: cancel or thank-you completion
  note right of IDLE
    HMI button dispatch is not globally restricted by state.
    Detection blocks button polling until its prediction wait returns.
  end note
  note right of DETECTING
    Main code blocks until three ESP-NOW messages;
    no collection timeout is implemented.
  end note
